<noinclude>
== Usage ==
Formats a compact count with an optional short-scale unit. Formatted for page language <code>{{PAGELANGUAGE}}</code>.

<pre>
{{Compact number|28.8|k}}
{{Compact number|475|k}}
{{Compact number|1.41|M}}
{{Compact number|1|T}}
{{Compact number|999}}
</pre>

'''Parameters:'''
* <code>1</code> — numeric coefficient (required)
* <code>2</code> — unit key: <code>k</code> (10³), <code>M</code> (10⁶), <code>B</code> (10⁹), <code>T</code> (10¹²), <code>Qa</code> (10¹⁵), or <code>Qi</code> (10¹⁸) (optional)
</noinclude><includeonly>{{formatnum:{{{1}}}}}{{#if:{{{2|}}}|{{#switch:{{lc:{{PAGELANGUAGE}}}}
